"""Cinematic community overview and dedicated Clubhouse presentation."""
hero_alts.update({'clubhouse':'Stone and timber Clubhouse and full-size pool in a tropical mountain garden','landscape':'Private mountain homes among lush gardens and woodland'})
pages['vision.html']=('The vision',
 hero('landscape','The Mount Paradise vision','Room for yourself.<br><em>A place to belong.</em>','Private homes in the trees. A Clubhouse at the heart. A landscape that brings them together.')
 +f'''<section class="section feature" id="discover">{pic('interior','Warm teak and volcanic stone interior opening to lush gardens','Stone, timber and light · Architectural concept')}<div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Rooted in the mountains</p><h2>Built around<br>what matters.</h2><p>Irregular grey stone, warm timber and deep verandas carry the character of the existing pilot into a new family of homes. Tree ferns, green hedges and lantern-lit stone paths shape gardens with room for privacy and time together.</p>{link('lodges.html','Explore cabins and lodges')}</div></section>
 <section class="section dark"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The shared heart</p><h2>Your place.<br>Our Clubhouse.</h2></div>{link('clubhouse.html','Step inside the Clubhouse')}</div>{pic('clubhouse','Proposed Clubhouse overlooking its swimming pool and mountain gardens','The Clubhouse · Phase 2 concept')}<p class="image-story">At the center of Phase 2, the Clubhouse and its garden pavilions bring the community together. Club Membership is planned to provide access to the full-size swimming pool, tennis court, gym and spa/baths, with an intimate mountain-lodge restaurant and café completing the social heart.</p></section>
 <section class="section feature">{pic('mountain-cabin','A compact stone and timber cabin in its own fern garden','Mountain Cabin · Architectural concept')}<div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A home at your scale</p><h2>Small escape.<br>Generous life.</h2><p>Begin with a Mountain Cabin, or explore the Retreat, Family, Reserve and Estate lodges. Each has a private relationship with the garden and a shared connection to the wider sanctuary.</p>{link('lodge-tiers.html','Compare the collection')}</div></section>
 <section class="section plan-preview" id="private-sanctuary"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Within the gates</p><h2>Take the scenic<br>way home.</h2></div></div>{pic('terrace','A sheltered mountain veranda surrounded by abundant planting','A slower mountain rhythm · Lifestyle concept')}<div class="thirds">{row('Arrive','A private approach','A private driveway leads to a gated entrance, with security and managed guest access supporting the privacy of the community.')}{row('Explore','Through the gardens','Golf carts follow stone roads between scattered villas, lodges and the Clubhouse. Smaller stone paths wind through the gardens for journeys on foot.')}{row('Return','Your own quiet corner','Homes sit among woodland and layered planting, with private verandas and garden terraces offering a quiet retreat from shared community life.')}</div></section>
 <section class="section" id="community-lodge"><div class="split"><h2>One vision.<br>Three chapters.</h2><div><p>The built pilot is the starting point. Phase 2 extends the community across 10 hectares, with a future expansion opportunity of 20+ hectares in Phase 3. Both later phases carry forward the wooded mountain setting, with homes nestled among trees and connected by landscaped routes.</p>{link('land.html','Explore the land')}<br><span id="club-membership">{link('clubhouse.html#membership','Explore Club Membership')}</span></div></div></section>''')
pages['clubhouse.html']=('The Clubhouse',
 hero('clubhouse','The Clubhouse / Mount Paradise','The heart of<br><em>the mountain.</em>','A favorite table. A mountain terrace. An occasion worth remembering.')
 +f'''<section class="section intro" id="discover"><p class="eyebrow">The Clubhouse &amp; its gardens</p><div class="split"><h2>One beautiful place.<br>Many ways to belong.</h2><div class="prose"><p>The Clubhouse is envisioned as the social heart of Mount Paradise: restaurant, bar, café and lounges opening onto the pool and mountain terraces. A separate Spa Pavilion and Recreation Pavilion extend the experience through the gardens.</p></div></div><div class="club-index"><a href="#dining">Restaurant &amp; bar ↓</a><a href="#cafe">The café ↓</a><a href="#events">Private events ↓</a><a href="#recreation">Recreation ↓</a><a href="#spa">Spa &amp; baths ↓</a></div></section>
 <section class="section dark" id="dining"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The restaurant / Bar / Mountain patio</p><h2>A table with<br>a different outlook.</h2></div></div>{pic('clubhouse-restaurant','Stone and teak restaurant with a bar and open patio facing the mountains','The Clubhouse restaurant & mountain patio')}<div class="split image-copy"><div><h3>Inside, warmly gathered.</h3><p>The dining wing carries the stone pillars, exposed teak and sheltered roofline of the Clubhouse into an intimate restaurant. A polished bar offers a place to meet before dinner or settle into the evening.</p></div><div><h3>Outside, the whole mountain.</h3><p>On the mountain-facing side, the restaurant opens onto a generous patio. Long lunches, sunset drinks and candlelit dinners share an uninterrupted sense of the landscape.</p></div></div></section>
 <section class="section feature" id="cafe">{pic('clubhouse-cafe','Cafe in the Clubhouse dining wing overlooking its stone columns and pool terrace','The café terrace')}<div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Coffee / Conversation / A slower morning</p><h2>Take your<br>usual seat.</h2><p>Set within the Clubhouse dining wing, the café opens onto the pool terrace beneath deep timber eaves. Comfortable chairs and small tables make room for an unhurried morning. Come for coffee and something fresh from the kitchen; stay for a book, a conversation or a second cup.</p><p>Green ferns, natural stone and warm timber keep the setting calm, with small pockets of flowers bringing soft color to the terrace.</p></div></section>
 <section class="section dark" id="events"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Weddings / Celebrations / Private gatherings</p><h2>Some evenings<br>deserve this setting.</h2></div></div>{pic('clubhouse-arrival','Valet welcoming elegantly dressed guests beside a silver sports car at the Clubhouse entrance','The Clubhouse arrival & valet drive')}<div class="split image-copy"><div><h3>An arrival of its own.</h3><p>A broad valet forecourt gives cars room to arrive, turn and pause beside the sheltered Clubhouse entrance. Guests step from the car into a warm welcome, with an arrival sequence kept separate from the pool terraces and garden paths.</p></div><div><h3>A gathering to remember.</h3><p>The restaurant, lounges and mountain patio are envisioned for wedding receptions, elegant private dinners, milestone celebrations and high-end events. Spaces flow from welcome drinks to dinner and an evening beneath the eaves.</p></div></div></section>
 <section class="section" id="swim-play"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The pool garden</p><h2>A little movement.<br>A long exhale.</h2></div></div>{pic('clubhouse','Clubhouse and swimming pool framed by restrained green planting','The Clubhouse & pool terrace')}<p class="image-story">A full-size pool sits at the center of the shared gardens, framed by a generous tiled terrace. Swim before breakfast, rest on the terrace, or follow the garden path toward the Recreation Pavilion.</p></section>
 <section class="section dark" id="recreation"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The Recreation Pavilion</p><h2>Room to move.<br>Space to play.</h2></div></div>{pic('recreation-pavilion','Stone and timber gym pavilion with a broad tiled pool terrace and a tennis court set farther into the gardens','The Recreation Pavilion / Gym & tennis')}<div class="split image-copy"><div><h3>A gym facing the gardens.</h3><p>A low, separate pavilion beyond the pool accommodates strength and cardio training, with wide glazing bringing the landscape into the workout. Its stone and timber architecture belongs to the same family as the Clubhouse.</p></div><div><h3>A court among the trees.</h3><p>The tennis court occupies its own spacious garden setting beyond the gym, with room around the playing surface and a dedicated approach. Keeping active recreation together gives it room to breathe while preserving the atmosphere of the restaurant and lounges.</p></div></div></section>
 <section class="section feature" id="spa">{pic('clubhouse-spa','Stone bathing pools in a separate teak-roofed spa pavilion facing the mountain forest','The Spa Pavilion / Baths & restoration')}<div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">The Spa Pavilion / A quieter garden</p><h2>A world<br>of its own.</h2><p>Tucked into a quieter part of the gardens, the Spa Pavilion has its own roofline, bathing pools and treatment spaces. A short landscaped walk connects it to the Clubhouse.</p><p>Warm stone, open forest views and the sound of water create a setting apart from the energy of dining, events and sport.</p></div></section>
 <section class="section plan-preview" id="membership"><p class="eyebrow">The Mount Paradise Club</p><div class="split"><h2>Your private home.<br>A shared mountain life.</h2><div><p>The Clubhouse, Spa Pavilion and Recreation Pavilion form a connected family of places, linked by the pool garden and stone paths. Club Membership is planned to provide access to the full-size swimming pool, tennis court, gym and spa/baths, close to the privacy of your own cabin or lodge.</p>{link('lodges.html','Find your mountain home')}</div></div></section>''')
# Put the Clubhouse on the homepage as a visual destination.
title,body=pages['index.html']
body+=f'''<section class="section feature">{pic('clubhouse','Cinematic Clubhouse and pool terrace surrounded by mountain gardens','The Clubhouse · Proposed architectural concept')}<div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">The shared heart of Mount Paradise</p><h2>Meet at<br>the Clubhouse.</h2><p>A swim, a match, a quiet hour at the spa. A favorite table and a familiar face. Explore the proposed social heart of the community.</p>{link('clubhouse.html','Discover the Clubhouse')}</div></section>'''
pages['index.html']=(title,body)
